WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.636
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind classify data into

00:00:05.636 --> 00:00:06.131
information.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:12.091
Sort: arranges data into an order. Category: groups items sharing a feature.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:18.445
Label: gives a clear name to a group. Pattern: is a regular feature seen in data.

00:00:18.445 --> 00:00:19.819
Chart: shows data visually.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:25.500
Collect a few harmless facts about classroom materials, NOT personal details. Make a

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.300
paper chart with the terms Sort, Category and Label; explain what each means.
